  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">NDG - Phase2 Trial Production Myanmar Mariculture</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Project&#x2019;s planned effect(s) on society is to establish a new industry (large-scale fish farming) creating alternative livelihoods and jobs, offsetting unsustainable marine fisheries and improve food security in Myanmar. The intended target group is the people in Myanmar benefitting of improved livelihoods and jobs.</narrative>
  </description>
